# Excitable Slime from WRIGGLE., a hidden quest in the Undercity canals (new in
# Forever).
# Sources: Wowhead Forever quest 97583 and NPC 269452 (giver and position, Horde
# only); Forever client
# 1.60.1.70338 (item 275682).

step WRIGGLE.
  tip Find the Excitable Slime, a critter in the Undercity canals, and /dance with it until it offers WRIGGLE. Buy Nutritious Slime Sludge from a vendor in the canals and bring it back; if the slime seems tired, dance with it again.
  accept 97583 "WRIGGLE." @57.4,63.6 live
  turnin 97583 "WRIGGLE." @57.4,63.6 live
  collect 275682 "Excitable Slime" @57.4,63.6 live
